This is a placeholder for the level-up sound file.

To add a real sound:
1. Find or create a level-up sound effect (celebration, fanfare, etc.)
2. Convert to MP3 format
3. Replace this file with the actual audio file

Recommended sources:
- Freesound.org (free sound effects)
- Zapsplat.com (free with attribution)
- Create your own with Audacity

Recommended sound characteristics:
- Duration: 1-3 seconds
- Uplifting/celebratory tone
- Not too loud (normalized to -6dB)
- Format: MP3, 128kbps
